# State: the Shore Control page shows the active job's Shore Control `set`, with its points listed.
# Vars: set (default Quayside control 2026) = the Shore Control's exact name as the job uses it.
# Passive-safe: no `key` steps. The page shows only the active job's copy; to look at another job's set,
#       run lib/app-select-job first.
#
#   run lib/app-open-shore-control set='Quayside control 2026'
#   pwsh -NoProfile -WorkingDirectory geodc -File dev/ui.ps1 do --file dev/ui-scripts/lib/app-open-shore-control.ui --var "set=Quayside control 2026"
@target app
@var set=Quayside control 2026

run lib/app-goto-page page=ShoreControlTab
wait --id PointCanvasPanel
assert --id ShoreControlStatusText --name '${set}' --timeout 3
assert --id PointCanvasPanel
